<title>USA: Optelecom Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Optelecom Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>GAITHERSBURG, Md. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Revenue		    $8,910,263		     $6,430,136</p>
<p> Net Income		    722,081			(208,384)</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     0.59			   (0.18)</p>
<p>				     1996			     1995</p>
<p>				Fourth Qtr		     Fourth Qtr</p>
<p> Revenue		     2,477,191			1,578,879</p>
<p> Net Income		    187,788			(114,196)</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share	     0.14			   (0.10)</p>
<p>Ed Ludwig, President and CEO of Optelecom said the focus, hard work and dedication of Optelecom employees are responsible for 1996's outstanding results.  &quot;Our total team effort resulted in record revenue and earnings for the company.  We are striving to maintain our momentum as we address new opportunities in 1997 and beyond.  While building a stronger organization, we will be adding exciting new products that meet the needs of our existing business base, and establishing a presence in new markets where we can create opportunities for significant growth.&quot; SOURCE  Optelecom Inc</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
